    "bounding box" : [ 184.288, 359.258, 380.966, 378.478 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "≤ (R′(ζ1)−δ),∀k ≥ N. So for m > N, we have,"
