    "content" : "for some γj lying between ϕmζ (x1) and ϕmζ (x2). Choose δ so that R′(0) < R′(ζ) − δ and observe that cm∆ ϕmζ (x1) − ϕmζ (x2) → 0 as m → ∞."
  }, {
